  "system": {
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>You learn the Find Familiar spell and can cast it as a Magic action without expending a spell slot.</p><p>When you cast the spell, you choose one of the normal forms for your familiar or one of the following special forms: Imp, Pseudodragon, Quasit, Skeleton, Slaad Tadpole, Sphinx of Wonder, Sprite, or Venomous Snake.</p><p>Additionally, when you take the Attack action, you can forgo one of your own attacks to allow your familiar to make one attack of its own with its Reaction.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-aKbhLPfPD3R9Y1KL\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Summon Familiar</strong> activity includes the normal summoning options and the <strong>Summon Familiar (Expanded Options)</strong> activity includes the additional options.</p></section>",
